    \ rate: 0.518\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.518\nTraining time: 1308s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.53 | 0.60 | 3.80 | 2.19 | 6.59 | 6.25 | 7.93 | 5.86 | 4.59 | 5.49 | 7.47\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.250 | 0.100 | 0.444 | 0.375 | 0.533 | 0.364 | 0.273 | 0.333 | 0.500\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1292s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.493\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.493\nTraining time: 1305s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: bfb3a776-f48f-4486-a133-665798aaea54\nTotal time: 1312s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-13 02:08:43,824\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing\
