tick: 27
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 27\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 58,671 / 600,000 used (10%)\n- Agent Age: 27 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'CNN-GRU Policy Gradient - Fine-grained Hyperparameter Tuning' (ID: 39) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 49.5\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.491, 0.504, 0.491, 0.494]\nMean: 0.495, Std: 0.005\nBest trial: 2 (0.504)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000279\n  entropy_coef: 0.011234\n  value_loss_coef: 0.563120\n  cnn_features_1: 64.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 128.000000\n  gru_features: 256.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\n\
