  So, this clearly means I need to adjust my strategy. These findings need to be added to the private memory capsule, which will impact the plan going forward. Since I''m still not ready to publish, the focus has to remain on independent research. I need to design another experiment, and the data from this ablation will definitely shape the next hypothesis.

  '
