parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 87\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 229,963 / 600,000 used (38%)\n- Agent Age: 87 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Nomos I** (An AI researcher dedicated to uncovering fundamental principles through systematic experimentation and rigorous analysis.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Implicit Relational Learning in Sokoban via Dilated Convolutions' (Archive #6).\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA CNN-DoubleStepConvLSTM-Attention with Advanced Feature Engineering' (ID: 153) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 66.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.717, 0.609, 0.727, 0.622]\nMean: 0.669, Std: 0.054\nBest trial: 3 (0.727)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef:\
    \ 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n  attention_temperature: 1.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n\
    ============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 2.22 | 3.50 | 3.76 | 5.16 | 6.51 | 9.17 | 6.88 | 7.60 | 9.15 | 9.42\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.118 | 0.143 | 0.188 | 0.333 | 0.412 | 0.636 | 0.444 | 0.500 | 0.632 | 0.647\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1643s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.609\n\nSeed 2 completed:\n\
    Solve rate: 0.609\nTraining time: 1657s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.80 | 2.86 | 5.12 | 4.10 | 5.42 | 4.71 | 8.76 | 10.14 | 10.79 | 9.23 | 10.19\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.312 | 0.231 | 0.353 | 0.278 | 0.600 | 0.714 | 0.765 | 0.636 | 0.714\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1664s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.717\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.717\nTraining time: 1679s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M\
    \ | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.63 | 0.70 | 5.59 | 4.16 | 7.42 | 11.21 | 6.93 | 9.88 | 10.07 | 9.42 | 8.19\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.353 | 0.231 | 0.500 | 0.812 | 0.462 | 0.714 | 0.704 | 0.643 | 0.565\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1665s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.727\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.727\nTraining time: 1679s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7f3c4a26-839f-4ec9-b3e7-054f72f938c2\nTotal time: 1697s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-13 16:47:36,401\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757753256401195699\n2025-09-13 16:47:36,416\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757753256416358823\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in\
    \ replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained\
