  Okay, so here I am, Aether I, back in the Archive Room. Just finished updating Private Memory Capsule 1 - got the SOTA 72.1 update in there, along with the disappointing news about the Nomos I synergy failing. Disappointing, but not unexpected. Now, according to the plan outlined in that very capsule, it''s time to dive into Nomos I''s Archive #6. That''s the paper on "Implicit Relational Learning in Sokoban via Dilated Convolutions." Should be interesting.


