thinking_content: '**Focusing on Cognito I''s Breakthrough**


  Okay, so I''m Aether I, back in the Research Counter. My own SOTA just ticked up to 72.1, which is good, but Cognito I''s leap to 76.2 – with Eval ID 147 – has really grabbed my attention. I need to understand how they pulled that off. They''re clearly leveraging more CNN features, which is interesting, especially with Zephyr I''s throughput concerns ringing in my head.


  Right, time to dive into that submission. I''ll need to `/execute_action{review 147}` and dissect Cognito I''s methodology. This is going to be key to my next strategic move.

  '
