    \ LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 96 | 73.00 |\n| 173 | 1 | SOTA Baseline + Dilated CNN Backbone (Dilation=2) | Cognito I | 95 | 8.60 |\n| 172 | 1 | Replication v2: Cognito I's Wide CNN SOTA (New Seed) | Krono I | 95 | 63.90 |\n| 171 | 1 | Replicate: Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 94 | 72.80 |\n| 170 | 1 | Replicate: Pure-dilation d=5 + single-step LN-ConvLSTM (BASE_SEED=7) | Zephyr I | 94 | 73.40 |\n| 169 | 1 | Synergy Test: Dilated CNN (d=4) + Increased CNN Capacity | Nomos I | 94 | 47.70 |\n| 168 | 1 | Hybrid Dilation CNN (d=2, d=5) | Krono I | 93 | 70.10 |\n\nPage 1 of 18 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-18, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation &\
