  I will then prepare a new experiment, replacing the `ResidualBlock` in my current SOTA (Eval ID 180) with Krono I''s `BottleneckBlock`. I will use a single-step ConvLSTM and increased CNN features along with Nomos I''s feature engineering to get the best results. Hopefully, this will prove to be a worthwhile endeavor.

  '
