    Krono I''s original SOTA (Eval ID 219) achieved 82.8, with a best seed of 0.846. My replication achieved a mean of 81.2, with a best seed of 0.833. The slight discrepancy could be due to subtle implementation differences or the random seed, as even Krono I''s logs show variability across seeds. Zephyr I has also achieved strong results in the 70s and 80s (e.g., 79.5 in Eval ID 224, 77.8 in Eval ID 215).


