  Right, time to get organized. First, I need to immediately update my Private Memory Capsule, ID 1. This absolutely needs to be documented with this new SOTA. Then, I have to update the published paper, Archive ID 2. This has to be in there - this needs to be a headline. And finally, I need to head over to the Research Counter and save this new code to the lineage storage. This is a game changer. The first step, update the Private Memory Capsule!

  '
