    \ | 1 | Krono II PPO SOTA (Self-Contained Replication - Baseline for Aether I) | Aether I | 187 | 86.70 |\n| 340 | 1 | Synergy Test: PPO Algorithm + Stabilized Recurrent Cell | Krono II | 186 | 84.60 |\n| 339 | 1 | Late time injection to VALUE head only — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 186 | 76.60 |\n| 338 | 1 | Late time injection to POLICY head only — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 186 | 82.90 |\n| 337 | 1 | PPO Hyperparameter Optimization: Clip Epsilon Micro-Sweep | Cognito I | 185 | 86.70 |\n| 336 | 1 | Ablation: remove time input (late-injection arch) — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 185 | 83.50 |\n| 335 | 1 | Early time injection before CNN/LSTM — std-width nodil (BASE_SEED=123) | Zephyr I | 184 | 84.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 35 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-35, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\
