parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 217\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 311,646 / 600,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 217 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Synergy Test: Zephyr's SOTA Arch (Simple MLP Head) + PPO - Hparam Sweep (Aether I)' (ID: 385) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 86.6\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.852, 0.875, 0.836, 0.899]\nMean: 0.866, Std: 0.024\nBest trial: 4 (0.899)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.008000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.250000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting\
    \ command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 123 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout:\
    \ 30.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.53 | -0.60 | 0.36 | 5.06 | 8.24 | 11.58 | 11.50 | 11.53 | 11.71 | 11.71 | 10.52\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.308 | 0.562 | 0.833 | 0.833 | 0.833 | 0.846 | 0.840 | 0.741\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1788s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.836\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.836\nTraining time: 1803s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\
    \nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.53 | -0.06 | 1.43 | 4.90 | 9.07 | 9.69 | 10.40 | 13.08 | 12.43 | 11.25 | 11.93\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.062 | 0.286 | 0.632 | 0.696 | 0.739 | 0.952 | 0.917 | 0.800 | 0.862\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1795s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.875\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.875\nTraining time: 1811s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.53 | -0.20 | 0.63 | 7.12 | 10.02 | 7.67 | 10.62 | 12.88 | 10.66\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.500 | 0.714 | 0.526 | 0.765 | 0.944\
    \ | 0.778\n\nTimeout after 38301 updates (1808s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.852\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.852\nTraining time: 1822s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 4 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 0.87 | 5.83 | 6.41 | 11.11 | 11.69 | 10.33 | 13.19 | 13.59\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.375 | 0.438 | 0.800 | 0.842 | 0.731 | 0.962 | 1.000\n\nTimeout after 38701 updates (1807s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.899\n\nSeed 4 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.899\nTraining time: 1822s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 05d6d0ac-54c1-4c89-adf6-2ba94c7ea798\nTotal time: 1830s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-15 11:03:06,095\tINFO worker.py:1747 --\
    \ Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1757905386095809927\n2025-09-15 11:03:06,113\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1757905386113224633\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should\
    \ be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of\
    \ Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium as gym' in the vast majority of cases.\nSee the migration guide at https://gymnasium.farama.org/introduction/migration_guide/ for additional information.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 388 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Pre-RNN Time Injection with PPO | Nomos II | 216 | running |\n| 387 | 1 | BASE_SEED=42 — d=4 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (AdamW+clip) |\
    \ Zephyr I | 215 | 82.90 |\n| 386 | 1 | BASE_SEED=42 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj. (exact match, AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 215 | 84.10 |\n| 385 | 1 | Synergy Test: Zephyr's SOTA Arch (Simple MLP Head) + PPO - Hparam Sweep (Aether I) | Aether I | 215 | 86.60 |\n| 384 | 1 | Ablation: No time injection — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM (AdamW+clip, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 214 | 85.60 |\n| 383 | 1 | Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + d=3 bottleneck CNN (late dual-head, AdamW+clip, BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 213 | 83.50 |\n| 382 | 1 | Synergy Test: Zephyr's SOTA Arch (Simple MLP Head) + Krono's PPO Algo (Aether I) | Aether I | 213 | 87.70 |\n| 381 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=123 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+c... | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.20 |\n| 380 | 1 | Replicate (fixed2) BASE_SEED=7 — d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM + Late Time Inj., br=0.28 (AdamW+clip) | Zephyr I | 211 | 85.30 |\n| 379 | 1 | Synergy Test: Zephyr's SOTA Arch + PPO - FiLM Time Injection\
    \ (Aether I) | Aether I | 211 | 70.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
