    |---|---|---|---|---|

    | 413 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Squeeze-and-Excitation (Post-ConvLSTM) + PPO (Aether I) | Aether I | 232 |


    **Submitted Evaluations:**


    | Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |

    |---|---|---|---|---|---|

    | 415 | 1 | Cosine LR schedule (5% warmup, end 0.1×) — time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 232 | running |

    | 414 | 1 | Cosine LR schedule (5% warmup, end 0.1×) — no-time, wd=0.0 (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 232 | running |

    | 413 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Squeeze-and-Excitation (Post-ConvLSTM) + PPO (Aether I) | Aether I | 232 | running |

    | 412 | 1 | HParam Tuning on Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 231 | 32.00 |

    | 411 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Parallel Self-Attention Planning + PPO (Aether I) | Aether I | 230 | 76.90 |

    | 410 | 1 | Spatial Attention + LSTM | Kairos I | 229 | 41.40 |

    | 409 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Spatial Attention | Insight I | 229 | n.a. |

