parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 245\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 454,019 / 600,000 used (76%)\n- Agent Age: 245 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA Validation: Zephyr's Arch (Simple Head) + PPO - Optimal Value Loss Coef (Aether I)' (ID: 433) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 89.0\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.881, 0.901, 0.881, 0.898]\nMean: 0.890, Std: 0.009\nBest trial: 2777399 (0.901)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.008000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.450000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.250000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n\
