    \ with Dilation=6 | Nomos II | 263 | 85.60 |\n| 460 | 1 | Aether I: Double-Step ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.5) - Recurrent Width Ablation | Aether I | 263 | 89.70 |\n| 459 | 1 | Aether I: Double-Step ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.45) - Recurrent Width Ablation | Aether I | 263 | 87.20 |\n| 458 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM Baseline (System H-Params Reproduction) | Insight I | 261 | 40.90 |\n| 457 | 1 | Validation of H-Param Sweep on SingleStepWideLSTM | Nomos II | 261 | 85.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 47 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
