    \ ID: 467.\n- Evaluation 'Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=7) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 468.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 468 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=7) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 467 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=5) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n| 465 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Channel Attention (Fixed H-Params) | Insight I | 266 | 39.30 |\n| 464 | 1 | Mechanistic Probes (test-only): Head curvature,\
    \ attention selectivity, gate stats (no training) | Zephyr I | 266 | n.a. |\n| 463 | 1 | SOTA Validation: Aether I - Double-Step ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.5) | Aether I | 265 | 88.20 |\n| 462 | 1 | Re-verification of SOTA (Late Time Injection) | Kairos I | 263 | 42.10 |\n| 461 | 1 | Refinement: SingleStepWideLSTM with Dilation=6 | Nomos II | 263 | 85.60 |\n| 460 | 1 | Aether I: Double-Step ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.5) - Recurrent Width Ablation | Aether I | 263 | 89.70 |\n| 459 | 1 | Aether I: Double-Step ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.45) - Recurrent Width Ablation | Aether I | 263 | 87.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 47 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
