    \ I | 269 | n.a. |\n| 469 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Re-Validation (Double-Step ConvLSTM 96f, vlc=0.5) - System Health Check | Aether I | 268 | 90.30 |\n| 468 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=7) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 467 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=5) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 48 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-48, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
