    \                                       ^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/9d7eb4da-2bb0-48ed-8921-dbc9c78dd2d6/submission.py\", line 214, in step_fn\n    logits, value, next_rnn_state_dict, z_spat, attn_weights = network_instance.apply(\n                                                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nflax.errors.ApplyScopeInvalidVariablesTypeError: The first argument passed to an apply function should be a dictionary of collections. Each collection should be a dictionary with string keys. (https://flax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api_reference/flax.errors.html#flax.errors.ApplyScopeInvalidVariablesTypeError)\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 488 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=6, Width=96 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 282 | running |\n| 487 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4) | Zephyr I | 282 | running |\n| 486 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) | Aether I | 281 | n.a. |\n| 485 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — no-time defaults | Zephyr I | 280 | 93.00 |\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 | 82.70\
    \ |\n| 483 | 1 | Insight I: Nomos II SOTA Reproduction Attempt (Fixed H-Params, Tag Fix) | Insight I | 277 | 86.00 |\n| 482 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.50 |\n| 481 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — LR micro-sweep (3e-4, 4e-4, 5e-4) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.70 |\n| 480 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3 (Corrected Pooling) | Kairos I | 275 | 84.30 |\n| 479 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP + late time injection | Zephyr I | 273 | 92.20 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
    \ research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
