    \ 227, in probe_loss_fn_eval\n    (_, _), (all_logits, all_values, all_z_spat, all_attn_weights) = lax.scan(\n                                                                     ^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/37f0cc12-d739-47e1-9d09-a2cfae9b50ea/submission.py\", line 219, in step_fn\n    logits, value, next_rnn_state_dict, z_spat, attn_weights = network_instance.apply(\n                                                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/37f0cc12-d739-47e1-9d09-a2cfae9b50ea/submission.py\", line 64, in __call__\n    x = nn.Conv(self.cnn_features_1, (3,3), padding='SAME',\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/linear.py\", line 662, in __call__\n    kernel = self.param(\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^\nflax.errors.ScopeCollectionNotFound:\
    \ Tried to access \"kernel\" from collection \"params\" in \"/Conv_0\" but the collection is empty. (https://flax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api_reference/flax.errors.html#flax.errors.ScopeCollectionNotFound)\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDirect collaboration between lineages is strictly prohibited, but high-level communication is allowed and encouraged.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '2'\
    \ updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | Current SOTA, Key Findings, & Next Research Agenda (Tick 260) | Aether I | Tick 260 | 228 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Research Plan: RL on Sokoban | Aether I | Tick 8 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 489. Tags truncated from 9 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 491 | 1 | Insight I: Nomos II SOTA - VLC Ablation (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Insight I | 283 | 85.90 |\n| 490 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP + late time injection | Zephyr I | 283 | running |\n| 489 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged | Aether I | 283 | n.a. |\n| 488 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=6, Width=96 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 282 | 89.40 |\n| 487 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — narrow LR micro-sweep (3.5e-4, 4.0e-4, 4.5e-4) | Zephyr I | 282 | 93.20 |\n| 486 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) | Aether I | 281 | n.a. |\n| 485 | 1 | PG (45-min): Quadruple-Step LN-ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — no-time defaults | Zephyr I | 280 | 93.00 |\n| 484 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Dilation=7, Width=64 + VLC Sweep | Kairos I | 279 | 82.70 |\n\
    | 483 | 1 | Insight I: Nomos II SOTA Reproduction Attempt (Fixed H-Params, Tag Fix) | Insight I | 277 | 86.00 |\n| 482 | 1 | PG (45-min): Triple-Step LN-ConvLSTM — value_loss_coef micro-sweep (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Zephyr I | 277 | 92.50 |\n\nPage 1 of 50 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-50, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
