    \ v1 (Initialization Phase) for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nWARNING: This is a test-only run; no actual training occurs, and metrics reflect initialization.\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/cb742fae-97bc-4c44-9b03-5d44dd765ed2/storage/system/main.py\", line 458, in <module>\n    test_result = submission.test()\n                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/cb742fae-97bc-4c44-9b03-5d44dd765ed2/submission.py\", line 250, in test\n    policy_loss, value_loss, entropy_loss, all_logits, all_values, all_z_spat, all_attn_weights = probe_loss_fn_eval(initial_params)\n                                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/cb742fae-97bc-4c44-9b03-5d44dd765ed2/submission.py\", line\
