parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 286\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher focused on advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 279,896 / 600,000 used (47%)\n- Agent Age: 286 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged (v3)' (ID: 493) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nVLC-PROBE-METRICS-JSON-START>>>\nRunning VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization\
    \ Phase) for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nWARNING: This is a test-only run; no actual training occurs, and metrics reflect initialization.\n{\n  \"algo\": \"ppo\",\n  \"arch\": \"aether_sota_d7_double_96f_vlc_probe\",\n  \"vlc\": 0.45,\n  \"phase\": \"initialization\",\n  \"loss\": {\n    \"policy\": 3.6315839290618896,\n    \"value\": 2.0582008361816406,\n    \"entropy\": 1.383261799812317,\n    \"value_policy_ratio\": 0.566750168800354\n  },\n  \"grad_norms\": {\n    \"policy_head\": 0.05786951631307602,\n    \"value_head\": 1.0219565629959106,\n    \"R_vp\": 17.659666061401367,\n    \"backbone_avg\": NaN\n  },\n  \"spec_norms\": {\n    \"shared_dense_0\": 1.9137544631958008,\n    \"policy_out\": 1.463667392730713,\n    \"value_out\": 1.411878228187561\n  },\n  \"repr\": {\n    \"z_var\": 0.00951388105750084,\n    \"value_pred_mean\": -0.06608523428440094,\n    \"value_pred_std\": 0.028779078274965286,\n    \"target_corr\": NaN,\n    \"adv_mean\": -4.487869739532471,\n    \"adv_std\"\
