    , line 454, in <module>\n    import submission\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/0d7036f8-2c3b-4aa1-9083-da8a9d3a07ce/submission.py\", line 519\n    return \"VLC Probe v1 (Initialization) completed for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\"\n    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nSyntaxError: 'return' outside function\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `update 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n5. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #3 ('Raw VLC-Probe Data &\
