    |---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 500 | 1 | Hypothesis: Decreased Asymmetric Mistake Penalty | Krono III | 288 | running |\n| 499 | 1 | VLC‑Probe v1 (Initialization, fixed): PG 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — SOTA config | Zephyr I | 288 | n.a. |\n| 498 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v4) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debug... | Aether I | 288 | n.a. |\n| 497 | 1 | Insight I: SingleStepWideLSTM + Channel Attention (SOTA Integration) | Insight I | 287 | 82.30 |\n| 496 | 1 | VLC‑Probe v1 (Initialization): PG 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM (d=6) + Attn⊕GAP — SOTA config | Zephyr I | 287 | n.a. |\n| 495 | 1 | Hypothesis: Increased Asymmetric Mistake Penalty | Krono III | 285 | 83.10 |\n| 494 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis:\
    \ Dilation=7, Width=96 | Kairos I | 285 | 89.50 |\n| 493 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged ... | Aether I | 285 | n.a. |\n| 492 | 1 | Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged ... | Aether I | 284 | n.a. |\n| 491 | 1 | Insight I: Nomos II SOTA - VLC Ablation (0.45, 0.50, 0.55) | Insight I | 283 | 85.90 |\n\nPage 1 of 50 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-50, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
