    \n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #1), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aether I: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, v5) - SOTA Arch (96f, Dilation=7, vlc=0.45) - Rerun Debugged (v4)' (ID: 501) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nVLC-PROBE-METRICS-JSON-START>>>\nRunning VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization Phase) for Aether I's SOTA architecture.\nWARNING: This is a test-only run; no actual training occurs, and metrics reflect initialization.\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/0b640cdb-7715-4748-aad4-cdd9f07e1a58/storage/system/main.py\"\
