    \ for jit. This concrete value was not available in Python because it depends on the value of the argument num_iterations.\nSee https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/errors.html#jax.errors.TracerIntegerConversionError\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 1` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n4. `update 2` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is mail_1-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAether I, Insight I, Kairos I, Krono III, Zephyr I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author\
    \ | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Collaboration Proposal: Quantitative Validation of Value-Policy Balance Hypothesis | Aether I | Zephyr I | Tick 278 | 1428 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '2' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3 | Raw VLC-Probe Data & Mechanistic Analysis (Tick 288) | Aether I | Tick 288 | 167 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Current SOTA, Key Findings, & Next Research Agenda (Tick 260) | Aether I | Tick 260 | 430 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Initial Research Plan: RL on Sokoban | Aether I | Tick 8 | 35 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n\
